#: korganizer/plugins/hebrew/hebrew.desktop:38
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Shows all dates in KOrganizer also in the Jewish calendar system."
msgstr ""
"Mostra todas as datas en KOrganizer tamén no sistema de calendario xudeu."

